I am now facing a balance of {$3000.00} w/ a 29.99 % interest rate. I believe that this is the goal of these finance companies - to not fully-inform consumers up front what the equal payments need to be, so that they can rake in HUGE profits. If I had been informed in my monthly statements what I needed to pay in order to avoid the full amount, I would have paid that amount. 
